# Everything this tool produces is generated, and none of it is tracked.
#
# data/   — extractor/exporter inputs, rebuilt by `run` from the
#           lockfile-pinned typescript/@types/node packages (ts_surface.json)
#           and the compiler at HEAD (baml_surface.json).
# report/ — the matrix itself. The canonical JSON report is a CI artifact
#           published per run, not a checked-in file; `run --check` compares
#           against a baseline passed with --baseline rather than one found in
#           the repo. Locally these are just scratch outputs.
data/
report/
